{"kind":"project","metadata":{"role":"project","category":"Orange Unified Design System","title":"Swift Package integration","categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)"},"sections":[{"image":"ic_unified_ds.png","title":"Swift Package integration","xcodeRequirement":"Xcode 26.5","chapter":"Import of the Swift Package and choose its librairies","estimatedTimeInMinutes":10,"kind":"hero","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS iOS is exposed through an open source Swift Package hosted on GitHub, and provides several librairies for your needs."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"These librairies help to split products and make users able to select only what they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI is the only official supported framework for Apple platforms."}]}],"projectFiles":"OUDS-Onboarding-Tutorial.zip","backgroundImage":"ic_unified_ds.png"},{"kind":"tasks","tasks":[{"anchor":"Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries","title":"Import the Swift Package and the libraries","stepsSection":[{"code":null,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Using Xcode, in your ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"project package dependencies"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", add a new ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"dependency"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Search with the GitHub repository URL (https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios), and select the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"ouds-ios"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" dependency.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You can then choose the ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"dependency rule"}]},{"type":"text","text":" you want."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To know which version you need, you can have a look on the "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki\/01-%E2%80%90-Available-API","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and also the "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/releases","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Let’s say you will use the some beta version, here 3.0.0-beta.8"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"step","runtimePreview":null,"media":"tutorial-onboarding-1-ouds-swift-package.png"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once you downloaded the package, you will see several librairies are available."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"They can be embeded inside your "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"target"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" librairies."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Things are separated to let users integrate only what they need and embed the abre minimum of content."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesContract"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" library provides the main elements like the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":". The theme contract is defined inside it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesOrange"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" provides the theme implementation for the Orange products, and contains also assets and all tokens for this theme."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesSosh"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Sosh products, and contains also assets and all tokens for this theme.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSThemesWireframe","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Wireframe theme, which is a theme dedicated to mockups and prototypes.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSThemesOrangeCompact","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Orange products but with constraints of sizes and spaces.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSComponents","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" contains the SwiftUI OUDS components defined with the Figma specifications, and also useful view modifers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSTokensRaw"}]},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSTokensSemantic"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSTokensComponents"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" are librairies defining and providing the tokens for low level (raw),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"middle level (semantic) or component levels (high level).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSModules","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is for modules or rich components with extra logic.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSFoundations","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is dedicated to some utilities and shared logic."}]}],"media":"tutorial-onboarding-1-ouds-libraries.png","code":null,"type":"step","caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add for example only the umbrella product merging all products mentioned above: "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSSwiftUI"}],"type":"emphasis"}]}],"runtimePreview":null}],"contentSection":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS for iOS is an open source Swift Package available on GitHub under MIT license."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The package and the librairies must be added through Xcode."}]}],"kind":"contentAndMedia","mediaPosition":"trailing"}]}]},{"kind":"assessments","assessments":[{"type":"multiple-choice","content":[],"title":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Which of these choices is correct?","type":"text"}]}],"choices":[{"isCorrect":true,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"I can contribute to OUDS using pull request"}]}],"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS is open source, under MIT license, and hosted on GitHub. Of course you can contribute!","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS supports officialy all Apple OS like visionOS, tvOS, watchOS, iPadOS, iOS and also CarPlay."}]}],"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The main supported targets are iOS \/ iPadOS. However we do our best to support macOS, visionOS, tvOS and watchOS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"CarPlay specific cases are not scoped yet."}]}],"isCorrect":false},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS provides UIKit components"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS supports only SwiftUI."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":false}]},{"type":"multiple-choice","choices":[{"isCorrect":true,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Some of the available products depending to my needs, or only ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSSwiftUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if I am very lazy and don’t care about my app size.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can import all products provided by the Swift Package, and tailor your choice to keep only the ones needed.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Even if we recommend to choose only the atomic products you need, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSwiftUI"},{"type":"text","text":" product wraps all of them."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"isCorrect":false,"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You need to chose the products the Swift package provides."}]}],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"None, only the Swift package dependency matter.","type":"text"}]}]}],"title":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which imports of the OUDS Swift Package products can I choose?"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"content":[]}],"anchor":"Check-Your-Understanding"},{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Let’s suppose we want to define a view for corporate apps with headings, texts, buttons and images."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"How can we do that?"}],"featuredEyebrow":"Tutorial","title":"Define information cards","kind":"callToAction","action":{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-2-nice-and-clear-view","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"text":"Get started","type":"text"}],"overridingTitle":"Get started"}}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-librairies"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)","modules":[{"projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-librairies","sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-librairies#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries"},{"kind":"assessment","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-librairies#Check-Your-Understanding"}]